gh","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_50"]},{"id":"fact_new_4","kind":"could_use","text":"The party's treasure map marks the dragon's location as \"Dragon's lair\"; Grimny says it is a very small cave of one big room that the dwarves scouted and found empty, a place nobody goes.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_1"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_18","beat_77"]},{"id":"fact_new_5","kind":"unknown","text":"Is there really a dragon? Dunk speculates that Bral is only pretending there is one to keep everybody away from the lair.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_16","thread_1"],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_78","beat_77"]},{"id":"fact_new_6","kind":"unknown","text":"What did Sir Brandon really do against his dragon? Vivian says the tale is told only by Sir Brandon himself, though he had many companions, and the church knows the tale.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_49","beat_53"]}]}